  settings:'m12 3 2 3 3-1 1 3 3 2-1 3 1 3-3 2-1 3-3-1-2 2-2-2-3 1-1-3-3-2 1-3-1-3 3-2 1-3 3 1 2-3Zm3 9a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0',
